# Keep the Docker build context small: dependencies and build output are recreated inside the image.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.qualis
coverage
# The static site; its app/ folder holds the pages the web UI shows (pnpm docs:build first).
docs/site/*
!docs/site/app
plugins/roslyn/bin
**/dotnet/bin
**/dotnet/obj
.DS_Store
